OL,3,GNEWSAMayor needs more spending powers,
OL,4,Aministers told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of London must be allowed to
OL,7,Fraise and retain money locally to fund
OL,8,Fmajor transport infrastructure projects
OL,9,Flike the Bakerloo Line extension,
OL,10,Fministers have been told.
OL,12,FUnder current rules, Sir Sadiq Khan has
OL,13,Fto lobby central government for funding
OL,14,Ffor any new schemes that cannot be
OL,15,Ffinanced by the Greater London
OL,16,FAuthority (GLA).
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
