OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor needs more spending powers,
OL,4,Aministers told
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal government expert Prof Tony
OL,7,FTravers said he believed many large
OL,8,Finfrastructure and housing schemes
OL,9,Fcould progress in London if some
OL,10,Ffinancing powers were handed to City
OL,11,FHall.
OL,13,FA government spokesperson said it was
OL,14,Fto overhaul the way the regional mayors
OL,15,Fare funded by replacing grants with a
OL,16,Fshare of local income tax in 2028.
